'''Neneko''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]]. She was added in [[Version 2.4 Update|Version 2.4]]. In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], she can be unlocked in the [[Cat Capsule|Rare Cat Capsule]] after clearing [[Moon (Empire of Cats)|Stage 48]] in Chapter 2. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], she is only available when rolling in either [[UBERFEST (Gacha Event)/Switch Version|UBERFEST]] (SEA) or [[SUPERFEST (Gacha Event)/Switch Version|SUPERFEST]] (JP/WW) banners.

